          "note": "This is a read-only overlay. Running a scenario admits a candidate load into the graph hypothetically and traces what it connects to — the generator's federal compliance record and any public enforcement. Nothing is accepted by saving; a scenario never writes to the graph. The residual — records not yet connected to a generator — is stated in Runtime, not hidden."
